      "Patients find it extremely difficult to control the worry or stop the rumination.",
      "The condition is defined by duration of at least six months on most days.",
      "Psychological symptoms are accompanied by muscle tension, easy fatigability, and poor concentration.",
      "Sleep disturbances, particularly difficulty falling asleep, are frequently reported.",
      "The clinical presentation often includes irritability and generalized restlessness.",
      "Unlike other situational fears, the worry is pervasive and not tied to a specific object.",
      "Functional impairment in work and social spheres is a common outcome.",
      "First-line pharmacological treatments target neurotransmitters like serotonin.",
      "Relaxation techniques and mindfulness training are commonly used to mitigate somatic tension."
