      "This opening allows shunting of blood from the aorta to the pulmonary artery.",
      "The shunt causes increased pulmonary blood flow and volume overload on the heart.",
      "It is more frequently encountered in premature infants and those with low birth weight.",
      "Clinical examination often reveals a continuous machinery-like murmur under the left clavicle.",
      "Peripheral pulses are typically bounding, reflecting a widened pulse pressure.",
